# Optional: EODHD token for broader symbol coverage for the dated daily stock-close reference.
# The app can use EODHD's demo token for AAPL when this is blank.
# Obtain a free token at https://eodhd.com/register
# Keep your real token in .env (never commit it) or your deployment's server-side environment.
EODHD_API_TOKEN=
